  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Convention on the European Union in the Republic of North Macedonia - Annual Work Programme 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;1. Strengthened role of the civil society sector in the EU pre-accession negotiation process&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.1. Increased capacities of civil society organisations for contribution in the EU pre-accession negotiation in North Macedonia according to the new methodology (in clusters)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.2. Strengthening the National Convention on EU in North Macedonia as a democratic forum for open and transparent dialogue on issues related to the European Union accession negotiations according to the new methodology in clusters&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
